    <title>000 到底是谁还在看电视啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65957cd56d045a7f5e7d559f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65957cd56d045a7f5e7d559f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jan 2024 21:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>📺</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>没有想到有一天，电视会成为一个第二器官。它搬到你的空间，生根发芽肆意生长。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>和我同一代长大的应该都有过一种这样的感受。放学回家最开心的事情，就是打开电视。它根植于的记忆中，缠绕而螺旋升空。所以即便是在当下各种终端都火速发展的过程里，我最喜欢的媒介形式还是电视。也许他不够便捷，也不够敏锐。但他始终没变，让你有的选但从不等待。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>⬇️指路跳过：</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 你还在看电视吗？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">06:01</a> 两种渠道，两扇世界的门。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 能刻光盘的剧，都应该是神作吧。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> 妈妈的经典小故事</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="897">14:57</a> 快乐家族曾经是我最早追过的团！</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a> 港片的普通话配音，一直令我着迷</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 把电视剧当作家里最重要的家具。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">22:22</a> “送”出去的电视机们</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> 城市独居青年图鉴</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>🎵</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>RJ Pasin - 片头</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>孙燕姿 - 遇见 孙燕姿 - 开始懂了 胡歌 - 忘记时间</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>🎙️</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>kaikai</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>欢迎常来，一起看电视👏</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2>]]></description>
